sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant K as alert-worker
    participant M as mongodb
    participant E as elasticsearch
    participant R as redis
    participant N as email and webhook
    actor D as DevOps engineer
    loop every minute
        K->>M: read enabled alert rules
        K->>E: count logs matching the rule in its window
        E-->>K: observed value
        alt condition true
            K->>R: EXISTS alert:cooldown:ruleId
            alt no cooldown
                K->>M: insert alert (status active)
                K->>N: send email and webhook
                K->>R: SET alert:cooldown:ruleId EX cooldown
            else cooldown active
                K->>K: skip, same incident
            end
        end
    end
    N-->>D: notification
    D->>M: acknowledge, comment, resolve
